        "brief",
        "ply",
        "cage",
        "record"
      ]
    },
    "python": ">=3.9 standard library",
    "inkscape": ">=1.2; operator-installed native executable, PATH or explicit absolute INKSCAPE; tested 1.4.4 on macOS arm64",
    "model": "Operator-selected Ask connection; no provider client or credentials bundled",
    "review": "Native correspondence, geometry, contrast, arithmetic and input bindings are checked. Framework judgment, evidence truth and visual quality require review. Documentation covers 17 frameworks; live evaluation is representative, not exhaustive."
